    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      510.56,
      286.69,
      601.04
    ],
    "text": "Two allotments of land called \u201cWemulla Watta\u201d in total extent of about 0.0158 Hectares, depicted as Lot No. 222 and 223 in Cadastral Map No. 320390, Block No. 2 of Block No. 4, Sheet No. 5 dated on 04.05.2016, surveyed and prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the village of Walagammedda in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kandy and Gangawata Korale in Kandy District, Central Province and bounded as follows:-",
